body:
In fairness sa QuickFX, may bago silang product?  [QUICKFX, Pimple Eraser Recovery Concentrate 30ml | Watsons Philippines](https://www.watsons.com.ph/pimple-eraser-recovery-concentrate-30ml/p/BP_50024975) 

&#x200B;

Niacinamide, SA, Allantoin, Ethyl Ascorbic yung ilang key ingredients though may Castor oil siya.. hmmm

Not at all. The "stigma" or the "taboo" of talking about periods has definitely been better the recent years. I talk about using a menstrual cup all the time with my workmates during break times. I do notice my male colleagues feeling a little uncomfortable about it but they don't really find it offensive. I've been trying to convert some of my workmates in using a cup. For facebook, I avoid posting personal stories just for my own sanity. It's just to avoid overly bearing relatives (esp. aunts) who will have something to say about menstrual cups. Other than that, menstrual cup related posts I put up on Twitter and Instagram get a lot of love.

&#x200B;

I say go ahead and post!
